WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.965 --> 00:00:03.729
- First, the bad news.

00:00:03.729 --> 00:00:05.889
Getting through the day can be hard.

00:00:05.889 --> 00:00:07.246
But now the good news.

00:00:07.246 --> 00:00:10.612
I just discovered a
beer called Stone Creek.

00:00:10.613 --> 00:00:13.225
Now Marty, tell me more about
that problem you were having.

00:00:13.225 --> 00:00:14.550
- Well, I was going out with my friends,

00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:17.080
and it was nice, but everything
was just kinda "meh."

00:00:17.818 --> 00:00:18.767
- What changed?

00:00:18.767 --> 00:00:21.029
- Well, then we tried some beer

00:00:21.029 --> 00:00:23.602
and things got a lot more fun.

00:00:23.602 --> 00:00:24.948
- And you felt warm, right?

00:00:24.948 --> 00:00:26.167
- Yeah, the warmth.

00:00:26.167 --> 00:00:28.420
- [Man] Stone Creek beer has
the ethanol clinically proven

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:29.999
to raise your blood alcohol level

00:00:29.999 --> 00:00:32.066
and get you feeling right.

00:00:32.066 --> 00:00:34.041
- I like a cold beer at the end of the day

00:00:34.165 --> 00:00:35.567
'cause I deserve it.

00:00:35.736 --> 00:00:36.871
- I like it because it gives me

00:00:36.871 --> 00:00:38.363
the confidence to talk to women.

00:00:38.363 --> 00:00:40.186
- Is it weird that I just like the taste?

00:00:40.186 --> 00:00:41.440
- So Marty, still worried about

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:43.019
a boring night out with your buddies?

00:00:43.019 --> 00:00:44.819
- With Stone Creek beer
I don't have to worry

00:00:44.819 --> 00:00:47.257
about a boring anything. (laughs)

00:00:47.257 --> 00:00:48.073
(bottles clink)

00:00:48.073 --> 00:00:49.156
- So again, you're my best friend.

00:00:49.156 --> 00:00:49.907
- You're mine.

00:00:49.907 --> 00:00:50.757
- Can't say it enough.

00:00:50.757 --> 00:00:53.057
- Yeah, this is fun.

